"""Declaration offered for an explicit act; importing this text declares nothing."""
DECLARATION_TEXT = '''I declare, as Human Governor and INTEVIA_FOUNDER_STEWARD, the standing constitutional exception for acceptance and publication of my own EDUCATION and LIBRARY content. This is a Decision of this root Living Organism only and is not inherited by other Living Organisms. It takes effect on entry into the root lineage, citing the recorded verification of its operative constitutional sources.
One deliberate Publish action constitutes my acceptance of the exact content version for public availability and my instruction to publish it. Acceptance and publication must remain two distinguishable recorded facts naming the exact version, my identity, the effective authority and this exception, stating that I accepted my own work and that no independent review took place.
Own content means that the person exercising the authority is the sole recorded author of every Session Version in the exact Course Release, or of the exact LIBRARY resource version being published. Ownership, coordination, submission, uploading or the latest edit does not establish authorship. Another author's contribution must not be concealed or removed to qualify. Co-authored work follows the ordinary route.
Any independently required authorisation for public release by another Living Organism, and applicable platform content requirements, remain necessary. This exception supplies only the root platform's acceptance and publication authority.
There is no separate submission application, self-assigned ESA, review queue, second human approval or additional acceptance click. Drafting or saving does not accept or publish. Recruiting other office-holders or acceptors does not end the exception; any change must be explicit and governed.
The exception passes with the Founder Steward function to a duly authorised Guiding Steward after independently established death, or an activated Emergency Steward during incapacity, only within the effective scope and time of their authority. Nomination activates nothing and the Founder identity never transfers.
CARE guidance is advisory and is never a prerequisite. Any actual Circle of Stewards concurrence may be recorded separately but is not required. The exception covers EDUCATION and LIBRARY only.'''

